{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>旅發局打造的「萬聖月」活動，即日起展開。</p><p></p><p>其中在中環皇后像廣場花園，已經有不少「嘩鬼」登場。最矚目就是這個，近兩層樓高的眼球裝置，吸引不少市民及旅客「打卡」。</p><p></p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.CENTRAL-1630.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20264aDKLbwSEa1792230444.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p><br/></p><p>旅發局擴大萬聖節活動，一連三個周末聯同商場、啟德體育園等，在多區如旺角、尖沙咀等舉辦特色活動，在中環蘭桂坊，晚上8時亦會舉行巡遊及嘉年華等。期間亦有特色電車，旅客「扮鬼扮馬」可免費乘搭。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.HALLOWEEN.CENTRAL-1630_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026YbvWm0E1Yj1792232378.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T10:59:34.828731+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T09:44:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T13:17:42.818336+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T10:57:41.338175+00:00","content_hash":"0b5c17aff13064a5992ceda0440272a89419519ce06650ccfcfece60430ed652","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}